ames>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Perugi</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Rihmer</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><article-title>Agitated 'unipolar' depression re-conceptualized as a depressive mixed state: implication for the antidepressant-suicide controversy</article-title><source>J Affect Disord</source><year>2005</year><volume>85</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>245</fpage><lpage>258</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.jad.2004.12.004</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15780694</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>